    ["你收到黑荆棘的任务，前往黑伍德庄园调查封印物失窃案。混入舞会后，你观察到一个举止惹眼的神秘女子、一位行为僵硬的黑伍德男爵，以及他身边那位戴着特殊眼镜的老管家。随着调查深入，你发现管家被封印物“看见我”侵蚀了记忆，而男爵早已识破一切，正等待幕后黑手现身……最终你协助男爵击退了隐藏的欺诈师，见证了一段跨越时光的主仆深情。"] = "You receive a quest from Blackthorn to investigate the theft of a Sealed Artifact at Heywood Manor. After infiltrating the ball, you observe a mysterious woman with eye-catching behavior, a stiff-acting Baron Heywood, and the old butler wearing special glasses by his side. As the investigation deepens, you discover the butler's memory has been eroded by the Sealed Artifact 'See Me', and the Baron has long seen through everything, waiting for the mastermind to appear... In the end, you assist the Baron in repelling the hidden Faceless and witness a deep bond between master and servant that transcends time.",
